# CODEOWNERS
# Every PR requires approval from the owner of the changed paths.
# Last matching rule takes precedence.

# Default: DevSecOps team owns everything
*                         @team-devsecops

# Pipeline / CI-CD
ado/                      @team-devsecops @team-platform
.github/                  @team-devsecops @team-platform

# Kubernetes / Helm
charts/                   @team-devsecops @team-platform

# Application source and tests
src/                      @team-backend @team-devsecops
tests/                    @team-backend @team-devsecops

# Container
Dockerfile                @team-devsecops @team-platform
.dockerignore             @team-devsecops

# Package manifest — both backend and devsecops must review
package.json              @team-backend @team-devsecops
package-lock.json         @team-backend

# Documentation
docs/                     @team-devsecops
*.md                      @team-devsecops
